5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that is actually sustainable for a year. I'm concerned about the actual time commitment required for these chores.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! But I also feel like the workload isn't balanced with how much we actually use the rooms. We should check that!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I think we should prioritize a method that prevents resentment. If we don't address the hidden tensions, no system will last.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know where the money goes! Who is paying for the sponges and bags? It's all a big mystery right now!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want it to be consistent. I hate not knowing if the kitchen will be clean or... grim when I go in.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, checking usage is a start, but we need hard data on the hours spent cleaning to see if outsourcing is logical.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! If someone is barely home, should they be doing the same amount of scrubbing as someone who's here 24/7?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, consistency is key, but we must be careful not to set standards that are impossible to maintain without fighting.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, if we outsource, who pays? We need to see the receipts for the stuff we already bought!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with @Victoria... I just want to stop guessing what the bathroom will look like.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the timing and the professional options. We need to know the real cost of our time versus a fee.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm going to check the calendar and the kitchen use. I want to see who is actually here and using the space!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I'll look into what everyone counts as ""done"" and the previous tenants' notes. I want to see where the friction usually starts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm on the money trail! I'll check the spray stock receipts and the management office billing. No more mystery payments!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll check the grout and the house chat. I want to see if the cleaning is actually happening or just being reported.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
